{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7EGCP8XSL44QBmhgZEF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Your answers will change what the letter says.\n\n1. **What's behind \"cut training time in half\"?** Do you know how long their new-hire training takes now, or have you shortened a training program before? Unless you have something like that, a hiring manager will read it as a guess from someone who hasn't seen their program, and it could cost you credibility. A promise you can back up would be stronger, such as making training stick so people are ready sooner. If you do have evidence, tell me what it is and I'll use it.\n2. **What's the company, the role title, and the hiring manager's name if you know it?** And besides GMP training records, what does the posting stress most? For example, onboarding, SOP training, compliance audits, or classroom vs. on-the-floor training.\n3. **How did your lab safety program work?** Did it include written procedures, sign-offs or competency checks, records of who was trained on what, chemical inventory, or SDS management? Anything like that maps closely onto GMP documentation and would help cover that gap.\n4. **What did you change in AP Chemistry to raise the pass rate, and what did the new-teacher training involve?** For example, did you write materials, check that teachers could do things on their own, or follow up with them? A sentence or two on each is enough.\n5. **Why this move, and what are you doing about the gaps?** For example, are you taking a GMP course or learning their LMS (if you know which one it is)? Is there any other reason you want this job or this company?\n\nIf you don't know some of these, just say so. I'll write around anything missing rather than guess."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":9540,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fed9d76c-8e67-42b2-917a-449eec61bdfa","uuid":"61d95f0a-bd21-42b0-be92-d05bbbd5fbc8","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:21:57.325Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7EGCAjaExNqXHHhWqUr"}
